OL,5,G0335 The Fenn Street Gang
OL,6,     FMr. Dunstable's wife leaves him
OL,7,     Fafter their last drunken row. He
OL,8,     Fdecides to move in with Dennis.
OL,9,     FBut Dennis, now making sweet, if
OL,10,     Fslow, progress with his
OL,11,     Fgirlfriend, has other ideas.
OL,12,G0405 The Fenn Street Gang
OL,13,     FMr Bowler likes Craven for his
OL,14,     Fstyle and wants Duffy on his
OL,15,     Fpayroll too. Duffy refuses, but
OL,16,     FBowler is determined and believes
OL,17,     Fanyone can be persuaded to change
OL,18,     Ftheir mind.
